  "description": {
    "text": "A half deck released for the film Pokémon Ranger and the Temple of the Sea, first at Japan's Pokémon Centers on 15 July 2006 and in other shops from 4 August 2006. It holds Pokémon of the film's characters, such as Phantom's Chatot, Samiya's Buizel and Brock's Marshtomp, with two holofoil cards, Sea's Manaphy and Manaphy's Egg, and brought the first cards of Mantyke, Buizel, Chatot and Manaphy.\n\nIt was the last Movie Commemoration VS Pack: the tenth film got the 10th Movie Commemoration Set instead of a half deck.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Sea's Manaphy (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 25 May 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260525123546/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Movie_Commemoration_VS_Pack:_Sea%27s_Manaphy_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A black \"Vs\" symbol at the bottom right, and a number out of 019",
    "sources": [
